00:13.960 --> 00:16.680
The first one, you have to learn it in order to talk to the data.

00:16.720 --> 00:21.000
You know, most of the companies stores their data in databases and this is a standard way.

00:21.000 --> 00:22.040
This is how they do it.

00:22.040 --> 00:26.760
And if you want to work on the company in the data field and you want to talk to their data, then you

00:26.760 --> 00:28.040
have to use SQL.

00:28.080 --> 00:32.440
It's like you move to another country where they speak another language and you want to live there for

00:32.440 --> 00:33.120
a long time.

00:33.120 --> 00:34.560
You have to speak the language.

00:34.560 --> 00:35.440
The same thing here.

00:35.440 --> 00:40.240
If you want to work with data, you have to learn the language in order to speak to the database, the

00:40.240 --> 00:40.720
SQL.

00:40.720 --> 00:44.600
So this is for me the most important reason why we have to learn SQL and SQL.

00:44.640 --> 00:45.760
