00:50.760 --> 00:55.240
data scientist, I promise you you will find there that they get a demand for SQL.

00:55.240 --> 00:59.760
So you will find they can ask for SQL skills almost in each job description.

00:59.760 --> 01:05.150
So if you check for any data related jobs you will find that they can ask for SQL skills.

01:05.190 --> 01:08.350
